the knowledge base giveth_example includes:

the text of the source program is at "sources/giveth-example.l4".

the square for a number N is a number M if
    M = N * N.

the maximum for a number N with a number M is a third number if
    N > M
    and the third number is equal to N
    otherwise the third number is equal to M.

an age N is adult if
    N >= 18.

a number N is even if
    0 = N mod 2.

