% a value with no LE form: (CONCAT "Hello, ", `name`)
%   l4:
%   | GIVEN name IS A STRING
%   | GIVETH A STRING
%   | greet name MEANS CONCAT "Hello, ", name
% RESIDUE r1 END

the describe for a num N is a text if
    N > 0
    and the text is equal to "positive"
    otherwise N < 0
    and the text is equal to "negative"
    otherwise the text is equal to "zero".

the safe head for a list is a number if
    [] is equal to the list
    and the number is equal to nothing
    otherwise prolog (the list=[T|N])
    and the number is equal to T.

