%   l4:
%   | GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
%   | GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
%   | countdown n MEANS
%   |   IF n <= 0 THEN EMPTY
%   |   ELSE n FOLLOWED BY countdown (n MINUS 1)
% RESIDUE r2 END

the triple for a number N is a number M if
    M = N * 3.

